	(text "J8/J9 go to off-board jacks. Unity after the preamps (RV1/RV2 set level).\nB is post-polarity. R46/R47 bleed C45/C42 so plugging in does not thump."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 250.19 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0b96335a-0966-554d-ab92-a09859f9a1a0")
	)
	(text "Low cut: C43 100n + R43 22k to VREF = 72 Hz. SW2-2 ON shorts C43 = low cut OFF (flat)\nLPF via R40 10k: SW2-3 C40 1.5n = 10.6 kHz, SW2-4 C44 2.2n = 7.2 kHz, both = 4.3 kHz\nSwitched legs return to VREF, so flipping them live gives only a small tick"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 215.9 133.35 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "19b70bca-1ff0-4cde-9ec6-97576fdaa175")
	)
	(text "Sidechain taken from BLEND (pre-gate) so the gate can reopen while muted. Q3/Q4 back-to-back: body diodes never clip the signal.\nQuiet: R52 pulls GATE high, Q3/Q4 short LPF to VREF (>= 10k via R40, about -60 dB). Signal: Q2 pulls GATE low.\nRV6 = threshold. Linking J7 grounds GATE (gate always open)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 269.24 196.85 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1daf4374-ee3d-45ac-8300-704c1dc87296")
	)
	(text "POWER  (9-18 V DC via J4; DC jack, battery and switch wired off-board)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "24a0c4bc-a931-4e1d-b9b5-affcfb6a25f9")
	)
	(text "BLEND (RV3) -> HPF / LPF (SW2) -> BUFFER -> MASTER (RV5)"
