	(text "1 = B polarity (on = invert)   2 = OFF: low cut 72 Hz, ON: flat   3 = LPF 10.6 kHz   4 = LPF 7.2 kHz   3+4 = 4.3 kHz\nStereo/direct outs are on J8/J9, not the TRS ring"
